  "question": {
    "text": "A solid sphere and solid cylinder of identical radii approach an incline with the same linear velocity (see figure). Both roll without slipping all throughout. The two climb maximum heights <math><msub><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></math> on the inline. The ratio <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi></math> is given by:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4c9b5464-a282-4d4f-9dc0-aafc226969a9-image22.png\" />",
    "image": null
  },
